Requirements: 6   with obligations: 5   deliberately none: 1

[task-01] An edit that differs from the text it replaced only in comments or whitespace
    changes nothing, and the review refuses it. It refuses it always, not only when the
    review is also checking whether an edit really makes its named defect true.
    -> comments-or-whitespace-only-no-change  [invariant/explicit]
       An edit that differs from the text it replaced only in comments or whitespace
       changes nothing.
    -> review-refuses-comment-or-whitespace-only-edit  [functional/explicit]
       The review refuses an edit that differs from the text it replaced only in
       comments or whitespace.

[task-02] The refusal is recorded as one of the review's own mechanical checks, not as a
    judgement about what the edit does, so that counts of what each judgement refused
    are not inflated by edits no judgement was asked about.
    -> refusal-recorded-as-mechanical-check  [invariant/explicit]
       The refusal is recorded as one of the review's own mechanical checks, not as a
       judgement about what the edit does.
    -> refusal-counts-not-inflated-by-unasked-edits  [invariant/explicit]
       Counts of what each judgement refused are not inflated by edits no judgement was
       asked about.

[constraint-01] No model is asked.
    -- no obligation, deliberately
       The requirement explicitly says no model is asked, so it imposes nothing
       checkable on the delivered change.

[exclusion-01] The questions the review asks about an edit's behaviour, and whether they
    run at all.
    -> no-behavior-questions-or-execution  [functional/explicit]
       The change does not alter the questions the review asks about an edit's
       behaviour, or whether those questions run at all.

[exclusion-02] Building an edit, or choosing the region of the code it falls in.
    -> no-edit-construction-or-region-selection  [functional/explicit]
       The change does not involve building an edit or choosing the region of the code
       it falls in.

[exclusion-03] Running the project's tests.
    -> no-project-tests-run  [functional/explicit]
       The change does not run the project's tests.

